# The `@waifucave` scope is read from GitHub Packages: the agent SDK's packages (`@waifucave/clover-*`, from
# clover-sdk) and the owner's other packages under the scope. GitHub Packages needs a token even to read, so the
# token comes from the environment, never from this file: NODE_AUTH_TOKEN, a GitHub token with `read:packages`
# (CONTRIBUTING.md: `NODE_AUTH_TOKEN=$(gh auth token) bun install`). CI passes the workflow's own token.
# Workspace packages under the same scope never touch the registry. Bun reads this file.
@waifucave:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}
